        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[🚀 New Features]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="-new-features">🚀 New Features<a href="https://your-docusaurus-test-site.com/ProperMusic.Documents.ProperWeb/releases/2-5-2-0#-new-features" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 🚀 New Features" title="Direct link to 🚀 New Features" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<ul>
<li class="">Onesheet preview available for standard suppliers</li>
<li class="">Product search/import for existing catalogue into proper web</li>
